WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:17.996
Everyone was at the grocery store.

2
00:00:17.997 --> 00:00:21.260
Dad pushed the shopping cart.

3
00:00:21.261 --> 00:00:27.143
Mom read the shopping list.

4
00:00:27.144 --> 00:00:34.432
"We need fruit," said Mom.

5
00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:38.226
Harry put apples into a bag.

6
00:00:38.227 --> 00:00:50.308
Emmy grabbed a bunch of bananas.

7
00:00:50.309 --> 00:00:55.093
"We also need vegetables," said Mom.

8
00:00:55.094 --> 00:01:05.120
"I don't like vegetables," said Oliver.

9
00:01:05.121 --> 00:01:13.727
Mom got broccoli and carrots.

10
00:01:13.728 --> 00:01:23.551
They went down another aisle.

11
00:01:23.552 --> 00:01:28.034
Harry put cookies into the cart.

12
00:01:28.035 --> 00:01:32.692
"Cookies are junk food," said Mom.

13
00:01:32.694 --> 00:01:44.449
Mom took the cookies out of the cart.

14
00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:50.460
Emmy put a bottle of soda into the cart.

15
00:01:50.461 --> 00:01:54.504
Mom put the soda back on the shelf.

16
00:01:54.505 --> 00:02:00.400
"We're not buying soda," said Mom.

17
00:02:00.401 --> 00:02:07.403
Oliver tried to sneak candy into the cart.

18
00:02:07.404 --> 00:02:09.962
Mom saw him do it.

19
00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:13.634
"No, Oliver," she said.

20
00:02:13.635 --> 00:02:19.632
"Candy is not good for you."

21
00:02:19.633 --> 00:02:23.278
Mom sighed and then looked at the kids.

22
00:02:23.279 --> 00:02:30.483
"Stop putting junk food in the cart," she said.

23
00:02:30.484 --> 00:02:34.564
Soon the shopping was done.

24
00:02:34.565 --> 00:02:38.638
Dad pushed the cart into the checkout.

25
00:02:38.639 --> 00:02:44.261
Everyone put the food on the counter.

26
00:02:44.262 --> 00:02:49.801
Mom found potato chips in the cart.

27
00:02:49.802 --> 00:02:52.616
She scowled.

28
00:02:52.617 --> 00:02:57.561
"Who put the chips in here?"

29
00:02:57.562 --> 00:03:00.911
"I didn't do it," said Harry.

30
00:03:00.912 --> 00:03:06.025
Emmy shrugged and looked at Oliver.

31
00:03:06.026 --> 00:03:10.634
"It wasn't me!" said Oliver.

32
00:03:10.635 --> 00:03:13.921
Mom looked at Dad.

33
00:03:13.922 --> 00:03:17.210
Dad smiled and shrugged.

34
00:03:17.211 --> 00:03:25.414
"I'll put them back," he said.
